RCW 39.10.410 and 2007 c 494 s 308;<paraend /><LineNumber line="14" page="3,14" hrt="no" />	(23) RCW 39.10.420 and <add>2013 c .<hardspace />.<hardspace />. s 1 (section 1 of this act),</add><LineNumber line="15" page="3,15" />2012 c 102 s 1, 2009 c 75 s 7, 2007 c 494 s 401, &amp; 2003 c 301 s 1;<paraend /><LineNumber line="16" page="3,16" hrt="no" />	(24) RCW 39.10.430 and 2007 c 494 s 402;<paraend /><LineNumber line="17" page="3,17" hrt="no" />	(25) RCW 39.10.440 and 2007 c 494 s 403;<paraend /><LineNumber line="18" page="3,18" hrt="no" />	(26) RCW 39.10.450 and 2012 c 102 s 2 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 404;<paraend /><LineNumber line="19" page="3,19" hrt="no" />	(27) RCW 39.10.460 and 2012 c 102 s 3 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 405;<paraend /><LineNumber line="20" page="3,20" hrt="no" />	(28) RCW 39.10.470 and 2005 c 274 s 275 &amp; 1994 c 132 s 10;<paraend /><LineNumber line="21" page="3,21" hrt="no" />	(29) RCW 39.10.480 and 1994 c 132 s 9;<paraend /><LineNumber line="22" page="3,22" hrt="no" />	(30) RCW 39.10.490 and 2007 c 494 s 501 &amp; 2001 c 328 s 5;<paraend /><LineNumber line="23" page="3,23" hrt="no" />	(31) RCW 39.10.500 and 2007 c 494 s 502;<paraend /><LineNumber line="24" page="3,24" hrt="no" />	(32) RCW 39.10.510 and 2007 c 494 s 503;<paraend /><LineNumber line="25" page="3,25" hrt="no" />	(33) RCW 39.10.900 and 1994 c 132 s 13;<paraend /><LineNumber line="26" page="3,26" hrt="no" />	(34) RCW 39.10.901 and 1994 c 132 s 14;<paraend /><LineNumber line="27" page="3,27" hrt="no" />	(35) RCW 39.10.903 and 2007 c 494 s 510;<paraend /><LineNumber line="28" page="3,28" hrt="no" />	(36) RCW 39.10.904 and 2007 c 494 s 512; and<paraend /><LineNumber line="29" page="3,29" hrt="no" />	(37) RCW 39.10.905 and 2007 c 494 s 513.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillEnd>--- END ---<PageNumberFooter lastpage="yes">		p. 3	HB 1768</PageNumberFooter></BillEnd></BillBody></Bill>